    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>B. The author picked the word because it is descriptive.</p>]]></text>
      <feedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Incorrect. This does not explain function.</p>]]></text></feedback>
