    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name><text>ENG4_U05_L03_Q05</text></name>
    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ENG4_U05_L03_Q05</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.ENG4.V.03</p><p><strong>Passage:</strong> The review described the performance as restrained, not dull. What does restrained mean in context?</p>]]></text></questiontext>
